    <div id="editor-app-shell" class="editor-app-shell" hidden>
    <div class="workflow-guide" id="workflow-guide">
        <div class="wf-step active" id="wf-step-1"><strong>1. Goal or marks</strong>Set project goal (yellow) or mark elements (purple hints).</div>
        <div class="wf-step" id="wf-step-2"><strong>2. Options A–C</strong>Updated by iteration after each goal/mark change — workspace unchanged.</div>
        <div class="wf-step" id="wf-step-3"><strong>3. Promote</strong>Click A, B, or C → refine with more marks or goals.</div>
    </div>
